the podium entrance is attractive and spacious. For shoppers’ convenience, there are 1,100 parking spaces.","descriptionContentTc":"竹園廣場鄰近港鐵黃大仙站及旅遊景點黃大仙廟，吸引不少本地居民和各地遊客來到這個舉世聞名的觀光點。竹園廣場的提升工程在2011年完成，設計以「竹」為題，以翠綠的竹林圍繞商場，象徵幸福好運。竹園廣場內有鮮活街市和熟食檔，滿足附近居民的所需所想，將好運帶給大家。翻新過後的中庭令商場變得更開揚，方便居民出入，平台的入口亦經過特別設計，空間感十足 。廣場設有1,100個車位，車主可以輕易為愛車找到棲身之所。","descriptionContentSc":"竹园广场邻近港铁黄大仙站及旅游景点黄大仙庙，吸引不少本地居民和各地游客来到这个举世闻名的观光点。竹园广场的提升工程在2011年完成，设计以「竹」为题，以翠绿的竹林围绕商场，象徵幸福好运。竹园广场内有鲜活街市和熟食档，满足附近居民的所需所想，将好运带给大家。翻新过後的中庭令商场变得更开扬，方便居民出入，平台的入口亦经过特别设计，空间感十足 。广场设有1,100个车位，车主可以轻易为爱车找到栖身之所。"},"mallInfo":{"shopCentreId":4,"propertyTypeId":2,"addressLabelEn":"Address","addressLabelTc":"地址","addressLabelSc":"地址","addressEn":"Chuk Yuen Plaza 15 Chuk Yuen Road Wong Tai Sin,  Kowloon","addressTc":"九龍黃大仙竹園道15號竹園廣場","addressSc":"九龙黄大仙竹园道15号竹园广场","customerHotLineLabelEn":"Customer Service Hotline","customerHotLineLabelTc":"客戶服務熱線","customerHotLineLabelSc":"客户服务热线","customerHotLine":"(852) 2325 5916","carParkEnquiryLabelEn":"Car Park Enquiry","carParkEnquiryLabelTc":"停車場查詢","carParkEnquiryLabelSc":"停车场查询","carParkEnquiry":"5487 7944","leasingEnquiryLabelEn":"Leasing Enquiry","leasingEnquiryLabelTc":"租務查詢","leasingEnquiryLabelSc":"租务查询","leasingEnquiry":"(852)2175 1375 / 2175 1891 / 2175 1864","websiteUrlLabelEn":"","websiteUrlLabelTc":"","websiteUrlLabelSc":"","websiteUrl":"","field02En":"","field02Tc":"","field02Sc":"","specialServiceLabelEn":"Special Services","specialServiceLabelTc":"特別服務","specialServiceLabelSc":"特别服务","specialService":{"serviceNoticeTc":"特別服務","serviceNoticeSc":"特别服务","serviceNoticeEn":"Special Services","serviceList":[{"shopCentreServiceTypeId":26,"shopCentreServiceTypeNameEn":"Bridal Dressing Suite","shopCentreServiceTypeNameTc":"新娘化妝間","shopCentreServiceTypeNameSc":"新娘化妆间","shopCentreServiceThumbnailPathEn":"/linkweb/api/file/SiteAssets/SectionPages/Shop/bridal_dressing_suite.svg?v=0d72ba5a35697c91fc9dd9c0c9a38f62","shopCentreServiceThumbnailPathTc":"/linkweb/api/file/SiteAssets/SectionPag