cysxc2/cysxc2_mkt.jpg?v=3863a00b073511edc2658297064ed575","marketPhotoAltTextEn":"Chuk Yuen Market","marketPhotoAltTextTc":"竹園街市","marketPhotoAltTextSc":"竹园街市"}],"recipe":null,"marketNews":""},"theNearestMall":{"titleEn":"Nearby Shopping Centres","titleTc":"鄰近商場","titleSc":"邻近商场","theNearestMallList":[{"shopCentreId":5,"propCode":"ftxxc2","shopCentreNameEn":"Fung Tak Shopping Centre","shopCentreNameTc":"鳳德商場","shopCentreNameSc":"凤德商场","thumbnailPath":"/linkweb/api/file/ShopCentrePhoto/ftxxc2/link-reit-business-asset-fung-tak-shopping-centrem.jpg?v=861c7023a12276cd02bc9d8860185f16"},{"shopCentreId":73,"propCode":"tsixe2","shopCentreNameEn":"Tsz Oi Court Retail and Car Park","shopCentreNameTc":"慈愛苑商舖及停車場","shopCentreNameSc":"慈爱苑商舖及停车场","thumbnailPath":"/linkweb/api/file/ShopCentrePhoto/tsixe2/link-reit-business-asset-tsz-oi-court-retail-car-park.jpg?v=db522b3b58e11f125a75df8bdd9c014a"}]},"sightseeingNearby":{"titleEn":"Sightseeing Nearby","titleTc":"鄰近觀光景點","titleSc":"邻近观光景点","sightseeings":[{"siteNameTc":"","siteNameSc":"","siteNameEn":"","siteDescriptionTc":"聯合到公園設有六個網球場，並備有其他運動及約了設施，包括一塊每邊7人的硬地足球場、兩個籃球場、一個兒童天地及一系列長者健身設施。園內的跑步徑有265米長，配有健身設施及卵石路，供市民強身健體。開放時間從上午7時至下午11時。","siteDescriptionSc":"联合到公园设有六个网球场，并备有其他运动及约了设施，包括一块每边7人的硬地足球场、两个篮球场、一个儿童天地及一系列长者健身设施。园内的跑步径有265米长，配有健身设施及卵石路，供市民强身健体。开放时间从上午7时至下午11时。","siteDescriptionEn":"There are six, tennis courts at Junction Road Park. Other sports and recreational facilities include: a hard-surface, 7-a-side soccer pitch, two basketball courts, children’s play area, and an elderly fitness area, a 265-meter jogging track with fitness stations as well as a pebble walking trail. The park is open daily from 7am to 11pm.","siteImagePath":"/linkweb/api/file/ShopCentrePhoto/cysxc2/link-reit-business-asset-chuk-yuen-plaza-sightseeing-junction-road-park.jpg?v=2c7197c433069238d84dbd91168cb721","siteImageAltTextTc":"聯合道公園","siteImageAltTextSc":"联合道公园","siteImageAltTextEn":"Junction Road Park"},{"siteNameTc":"","siteNameSc":"","siteNameEn":"","siteDescriptionTc":"摩士公園以二戰時期逝世的匯豐銀行主席兼總司理雅瑟‧摩士爵士命名，佔地16公頃，屬城市公園。這個熱帶棕櫚樹林於植物區內種有23種棕櫚樹及30餘種珍稀樹種，令園地綠樹成蔭。此外，公園更設有的露天圓形劇場（部分座位設有天幕）、游泳池、適合多項運動的體育中心及一個蝴蝶閣，一應俱全，適合需要遠離煩囂的都市人士。","siteDescriptionSc":"摩士公园以二战时期逝世的汇丰银行主席兼总司理雅瑟‧摩士爵士命名，占地16公顷，属城市公园。这个热带棕榈树林於植物区内种有23种棕榈树及30余种珍稀树种，令园地绿树成荫。此外，公园更设有的露天圆形剧场（部分座位设有天幕）、游泳池、适合多项运动的体育中心及一个蝴蝶阁，一应俱全，适合需要远离烦嚣的都市人士。","siteDescriptionEn":"Named after Sir Arthur Morse, the head of The Hong Kong and Shanghai Banking Corporation during and after World War II, Morse Park is a nearly 16-hectare urban park. A tropical palm garden with 23 species and another 30 rare species of trees in the park’s arboretum provide plenty of shaded lawns in Morse Park. The park also contains an amphitheater with partially covered seating, swimming pool, sports center for a variety of sports, and a butterfly corner.","siteImagePath":"/linkweb/api/file/ShopCentrePhoto/cysxc2/link-reit-business-asset-chuk-yuen-plaza-sightseeing-morse-park.jpg?v=c802b65a121c0aaa7e2ba6838113e2aa","siteImageAltTextTc":"摩士公園","siteImageAltTextSc":"摩士公园","siteImageAltTextEn":"Morse Park "},{"siteNameTc":"","siteNameSc":"","siteNameEn":"","siteDescriptionTc":"蒲崗村道公園坐落鑽石山中央，佔地9公頃，是消閒娛樂好去處。公園的「可再生能源區」內設置了多塊展板介紹公園內的可再生能源設施包括風能、光電和太陽能，藉此向遊人宣揚保護環境的訊息。此外，公園提供的多元化康樂設施包括一條長約一公里的高架單車徑、BMX單車場和苗圃，設施一應俱全。","siteDescriptionSc":"蒲岗村道公园坐落钻石山中央，占地9公顷，是消闲娱乐好去处。公园的「可再生能源区」内设置了多块展板介绍公园内的可再生能源设施包括风能、光电和太阳能，藉此向游人宣扬保护环境的讯息。此外，公园提供的多元化康乐设施包括一条长约一公里的高架单车径、BMX单车场和苗圃，设施一应俱全。","siteDescriptionEn":"This 9-hectare park in the midst of Diamond Hill is not just a haven for relaxation and recreation. It features a “Renewable Energy Zone” exhibition with educational panels on different renewable energy systems such as wind, photovoltaic, and solar power. In addition to learning about more environmentally sustainable energy sources, some key attractions of the park include a BMX cycling area, a 1km-long cycling track, and even a nursery.","siteImagePath":"/linkweb/api/file/ShopCentrePhoto/cysxc2/link-reit-business-asset-chuk-yuen-plaza-sightseeing-po-kong-village-road-park.jpg?v=a20645afab48c6d58444c8ad0ea0e38d","siteImageAltTextTc":"蒲崗村道公園","siteImageAltTextSc":"蒲岗村道公园","siteImageAltTextEn":"Po Kong Village Road Park"},{"siteNameTc":"","siteNameSc":"","siteNameEn":"","siteDescriptionTc":"鳳德公園內的康樂及休憩設施均以中國神話『西遊記』中的情節為設計主題，將“齊天大聖”『孫悟空』、『唐三藏』、『豬八戒』和『沙僧』等膾炙人口的角色栩栩如生地逐一呈現，就連園內的壁畫和園景也是向這部不朽名著取材，如水簾洞、五指山、水晶宮等，頗具特色。","siteDescriptionSc":"凤德公园内的康乐及休憩设施均以中国神话『西游记』中的情节为设计主题，将“齐天大圣”『孙悟空』、『唐三藏』、『猪八戒』和『沙僧』等脍炙人口的角色栩栩如生地逐一呈现，就连园内的壁画和园景也是向这部不朽名着取材，如水帘洞、五指山、水晶宫等，颇具特色。","siteDescriptionEn":"Go on a Journey to the West! Within walking distance of Wong Tai Sin Temple is Fung Tak Park, which recreates the classic Chinese tale of the Monkey King, Sun Wukong, and his adventures. The park’s wall murals and landscapes draw on the story for inspiration. There is a grotto with waterfalls and scenes reminiscent of Five Fingers Mountain and Crystal Palace.","siteImagePath":"/linkweb/api/file/ShopCentrePhoto/cysxc2/link-reit-business-asset-chuk-yuen-plaza-sightseeing-fung-tak-park.jpg?v=0a72dfb2cfd19459df568da89bac2b1f","siteImageAltTextTc":"鳳德公園","siteImageAltTextSc":"凤德公园","siteImageAltTextEn":"Fung Tak Park"}]}}}